' M16/R47 crash isolation #00 - no image capture and no bank access.
' Run only in a SAVED, ISOLATED WinUAE test config with R47 candidate.
' Use Project -> Merge ASCII in a new, empty program.
' This test only calls R46-compatible Detect, Open and Close.
' If WinUAE crashes, report the LAST STEP visible on AMOS screen.
Cls
Print "R47 DIAG 00 - NO CAPTURE"
Print "S01 BEFORE DETECT"
_DET=Aga Detect
Print "S02 DETECT RETURNED ";_DET
If _DET=0
   Print "RESULT 0 - NO AGA"
   End
End If
Print "S03 BEFORE OPEN"
_OPEN=Aga Screen Open(320,256,16,$00021000)
If _OPEN<>1
   Print "S04 OPEN FAILED ";_OPEN
   Print "RESULT 0"
   End
End If
' Open may cover the AMOS text; a successful Close returns to it.
Aga Screen Close
Amos To Front
Print "S05 OPEN/CLOSE RETURNED ";_OPEN
Print "RESULT 1"
End
